WEBVTT

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.617
Narrator: Number four,
no lettering or seals.

00:07:01.641 --> 00:07:03.877
Never use writing of any kind.

00:07:03.901 --> 00:07:06.499
RM: Underneath the phoenix,
there's a motto on a ribbon

00:07:06.523 --> 00:07:09.478
that translates to
"Gold in peace, iron in war,"

00:07:09.502 --> 00:07:11.833
plus -- and this is the big problem --

00:07:11.857 --> 00:07:15.066
it says San Francisco across the bottom.

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:18.925
TK: If you need to write the name
of what you're representing on your flag,

00:07:18.949 --> 00:07:20.725
your symbolism has failed.

00:07:20.749 --> 00:07:22.525
(Laughter)

00:07:22.549 --> 00:07:24.553
(Applause)

00:07:24.577 --> 00:07:28.518
RM: The United States flag
doesn't say "USA" across the front.

00:07:28.542 --> 00:07:31.699
In fact, country flags,
they tend to behave.